    "parts": [
      {
        "id": 6438,
        "quiz_id": 6369,
        "passage": 2,
        "title": "Listening Passage 2",
        "sort": 2,
        "content": "",
        "explanations": [],
        "questions": [],
        "vocabs": [
          {
            "id": 842349,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842350,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: Good morning, and welcome to the museum -- one with a remarkable range of exhibits, which I’m sure you’ll enjoy.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 68.36,
                  "from": 61.8,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842371,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My name’s Greg, and I’ll tell you about the various collections as we go round.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 72.68,
                  "from": 68.6,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842387,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But before we go, let me just give you a taste of what we have here.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 77.15,
                  "from": 73.15,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842403,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842404,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: Well, for one thing, we have a fine collection of twentieth and twenty-first century paintings, many by very well-known artists.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 84.58,
                  "from": 77.94,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842424,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’m sure you’ll recognise several of the paintings.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 86.75,
                  "from": 84.58,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842433,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This is the gallery that attracts the largest number of visitors, so it’s best to go in early in the day, before the crowds arrive.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 94.0,
                  "from": 87.36,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842459,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842460,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: The there are the nineteenth-century paintings.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 97.52,
                  "from": 94.88,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842467,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The museum was opened in the middle of that century, and several of the artists each donated one work -- to get the museum started, as it were.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 105.56,
                  "from": 97.52,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842496,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So they’re of special interest to us -- we feel closer to them than to other works.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 110.52,
                  "from": 105.88,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842513,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842514,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: The sculpture gallery has a number of fine exhibits, but I’m afraid it’s currently closed for refurbishment.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 116.98,
                  "from": 111.08,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842531,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You’ll need to come back next year to see it properly, but a number of the sculptures have been moved to other parts of the museum.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 123.62,
                  "from": 117.14,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842557,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842558,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: ’Around the world’ is a temporary exhibition -- you’ve probably seen something about it on TV or in the newspapers.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 131.56,
                  "from": 124.5,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842578,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It’s created a great deal of interest, because it presents objects from every continent and many countries, and provides information about their social context -- why they were made, who for, and so on.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 144.73,
                  "from": 131.63,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842612,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842613,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: Then there’s the collection of coins.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 147.13,
                  "from": 145.13,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842620,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This is what you might call a focused, specialist collection, because all the coins come from this country, and were produced between two thousand and a thousand years ago.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 163.82,
                  "from": 147.61,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842648,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And many of them were discovered by ordinary people digging their gardens and donated to the museum!",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 163.82,
                  "from": 147.61,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842666,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842667,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: All our porcelain and glass we left to the museum by its founder, when he died in 1878.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 174.7,
                  "from": 164.94,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842686,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And in the terms of his will, we’re not allowed to add anything to that collection: he believed it was perfect in itself, and we don’t see any reason to disagree!",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 179.5,
                  "from": 174.86,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842718,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842719,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: OK, that was something about the collections, and now here’s some more practical information, in case you need it.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 224.72,
                  "from": 218.88,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842739,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Most of the museum facilities are downstairs, in the basement, so you go down the stairs here.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 232.01,
                  "from": 225.77,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842757,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "When you reach the bottom of the stairs, you’ll find yourself in a sitting area, with comfortable chairs and sofas where you can have a rest before continuing your exploration of the museum.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 242.62,
                  "from": 232.33,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842783,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842784,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: We have a very good restaurant, which serves excellent food all day, in a relaxing atmosphere.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 249.03,
                  "from": 243.58,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842799,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "To reach it, when you get to the bottom of the stairs, go straight ahead to the far side of the sitting area, then turn right into the corridor.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 259.05,
                  "from": 249.42,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842829,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You’ll see the door on the restaurant facing you.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 261.93,
                  "from": 259.45,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842840,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842841,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: If you just want a snack, or if you’d like to eat somewhere with facilities for children, we also have a café.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 269.38,
                  "from": 263.22,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842862,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "When you reach the bottom of the stairs, you’ll need to go straight ahead, turn right into the corridor, and the café is immediately on the right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 279.68,
                  "from": 269.78,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842890,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842891,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: And talking about children, there are baby-changing facilities downstairs: cross the sitting area, continue straight ahead along the corridor on the left and you and your baby will find the facilities on the left-hand side.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 294.53,
                  "from": 280.48,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842927,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842928,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: The cloakroom where you should leave coats, umbrella and any large bags, is on the left hand side of the sitting area.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 303.17,
                  "from": 295.88,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 842952,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It’s through the last door before you come to the corridor.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 307.95,
                  "from": 304.03,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842964,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842965,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: There are toilets on every floor, but in the basement they’re the first rooms on the left when you get down there.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 315.31,
                  "from": 308.35,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 842988,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 842989,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "GREG: OK, now if you’ve got anything to leave in the cloakroom, please do that now, and then we’ll start our tour.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 322.51,
                  "from": 316.84,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
